@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@userId =
@mailId =

### Create user
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "max.mustermann@example.com",
  "firstName": "Max",
  "lastName": "Mustermann",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Get all users
GET {{baseUrl}}/users

### Get user by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/8db5418b-cd4f-486f-8511-4cbcef54b827

### Create draft mail
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/8db5418b-cd4f-486f-8511-4cbcef54b827/mails
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sender": "max.mustermann@example.com",
  "to": "anna@example.com",
  "cc": "team@example.com",
  "bcc": "",
  "subject": "Test Mail",
  "body": "Hallo, das ist eine Test Mail."
}

### Get all mails of user
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/8db5418b-cd4f-486f-8511-4cbcef54b827/mails

### Get mail by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/8db5418b-cd4f-486f-8511-4cbcef54b827/mails/{{mailId}}

### Send draft mail
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/mails/{{mailId}}/send

### Send same draft again - should fail
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/mails/{{mailId}}/send